urce":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The head of the “Red Lily Dormitory,” a dormitory that is thoroughly dedicated to sports perfomance. She is an all-around athlete who achieves top-level results in a wide variety of sports. She is a victory supremacist who believes that if she does not win, it is meaningless. She hates people who are unwilling to put in the effort to achieve this (i.e., those who do not like to practice), and she imposes hard training on the dorm residents as well. She sometimes uses violence as a form of coaching, and some of the dorm residents complain about it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c144197"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツの成績に徹底してこだわる“紅百合寮”の寮長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"多種多様な競技でトップレベルの成績を叩き出す万能選手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝たなければ意味がないという勝利至上主義者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのための努力を惜しむ（練習を嫌がる）人間を毛嫌いしており、寮生たちにもハードな練習を課している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"指導と称して暴力を振るうこともあるため、寮生からは不満の声が上がることも。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27551","sourceWorkId":"36711","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝利こそ正義の絶対帝王"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツの成績に徹底してこだわる“紅百合寮”の寮長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"多種多様な競技でトップレベルの成績を叩き出す万能選手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝たなければ意味がないという勝利至上主義者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのための努力を惜しむ（練習を嫌がる）人間を毛嫌いしており、寮生たちにもハードな練習を課している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"指導と称してぼう力を振るうこともあるため、寮生からは不満の声が上がることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「負け犬に用はねぇ。勝つ気がないんだったら今すぐ失せろ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"185875"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"185875","value":"2年5組"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27551","sourceWorkId":"36711","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27551","sourceWorkId":"36711","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"168 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27551","sourceWorkId":"36711","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27551","sourceWorkId":"36711","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27551","sourceWorkId":"36711","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"61 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27551","sourceWorkId":"36711","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d520e6e3da9a1dcc3ed9a3ec0bf52fb88773172d0b4b1f39443757890eed9b20.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b24f4aaa62863c1dd02783d18e33e9ec40dbbc2b8edb1519526184456a9613c.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深田紗記子","creatorId":"vndb:s1658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1658","name":"葵時緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:501701:185875:17079:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c144198","characterName":"鈴谷　梨子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"185876","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"501701"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27552"],"vndbCharacterId":"c144198"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴谷　梨子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"77"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"76"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"43"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a childhood friend of Ibuki Akane, the head of the Red Lily dormitory, and serves as the deputy head of the dormitory. Although she and Akane compete in different sports, they are good rivals and close friends. However, Riko gave up on sports in her first year due to a chronic illness. Since then, she has chosen to contribute to the Red Lily dormitory as a manager. She has known Akane for a long time and is a valuable person who can express her opinions to Akane head-on. Riko's kind and devoted support as a manager is a comfort to the students who are exhausted by the excessive training Akane imposes on them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c144198"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼馴染のあかねとは、競技は違えど良きライバルであり親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし梨子は一年生の時に、持病のため競技を続けることを断念。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以後はマネージャーとして紅百合寮で貢献する道を選んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔からの付き合いもあり、あかねに正面から意見を言える貴重な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あかねの課す過剰な特訓で疲弊した寮生たちにとって、マネージャーとして優しく献身的に支えてくれる梨子は、心の癒やしでもある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27552","sourceWorkId":"36711","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"殺伐とした紅百合寮の良心"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼馴染のあかねとは、競技は違えど良きライバルであり親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし梨子は一年生の時に、持病のため競技を続けることを断念。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"以後はマネージャーとして紅百合寮で貢献する道を選んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔からの付き合いもあり、あかねに正面から意見を言える貴重な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あかねの課す過剰な特訓で疲弊した寮生たちにとって、マネージャーとして優しく献身的に支えてくれる梨子は、心の癒やしでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「も～、あかねちゃんったら。しょうがないんだから」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId"